<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Headspace</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">grentperez</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Backflips in a Restaurant</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">669IPhhZxybm6pmNlwKiO0</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.801" end="00:17.179">You live on the other side of town</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.179" end="00:23.279">Always kicking up those rocks on the ground</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.279" end="00:28.345">Call me up again just to say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.345" end="00:34.102">How you wasted all your days away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.102" end="00:35.602" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.089" end="00:40.273">You told me every little single sound then complain, and I'll</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.273" end="00:46.503">Use up every little energy inside my brain, but that's okay, I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.503" end="00:48.505">Notice what you're going through today</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.505" end="00:54.937">And they all say it's gonna be okay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.937" end="00:59.448">So while we're here why don't we run away?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.448" end="01:02.192">Took a little holiday</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.192" end="01:07.646">'Cause life's too short for you to be crammed in your headspace</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.646" end="01:11.204">Lets make fun of movie stars (Movie stars)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.204" end="01:14.170">I'll call right after dark (After dark)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.170" end="01:19.098">Or just something that'll leave those thoughts astray</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.098" end="01:22.713">When you're thinking that way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.713" end="01:30.713" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.878" end="01:49.569">You told me every little single sound then complain, and I'll</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.569" end="01:55.443">Use up every little energy inside my brain, but that's okay, I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.443" end="01:57.771">Notice what you're going through today</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.771" end="02:03.549">And they all say it's gonna be okay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.549" end="02:08.895">So while we're here why don't we run away?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.895" end="02:11.458">Took a little holiday</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.458" end="02:17.069">'Cause life's too short for you to be crammed in your headspace</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.069" end="02:20.377">Lets make fun of movie stars (Movie stars)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.377" end="02:23.233">I'll call right after dark (After dark)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.233" end="02:28.026">Or just something that'll leave those thoughts astray</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.026" end="02:32.026">When you're thinking that way</p></div></body></tt>